10_6877594147168239640_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=81rTdk33PFgQ7kNvwG0uswd&_nc_oc=Adoij5e47IiJiIbglN9Sp5eY0GzJKqEbpRg0LZtul0f6a1npG8dbNrXMo1AGn8o4bXI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-stXUF37jM2pcutCG_kQQ6_iSnp9zVlWcNTX8FVSB3hw&oe=6A300B4C"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "2953570888277783", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392093_2953570891611116_6048066563426032845_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hxLtuOCVUt0Q7kNvwG2ZEX_&_nc_oc=AdqdC5k_9O15b5cCNqgh2MTukE2nNub9sIi6i5AYzwOdkdiL6dsjduz2PYelcnByvgI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_ujrPDED9s-l7UCpDhQRwamhqsv40TWCBXLjiwoeG7vQ&oe=6A301C3C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "The Finders_Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1629436301031148", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392069_1629436304364481_4255148496526447739_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1iMO3gVVGeQQ7kNvwGfY8Aa&_nc_oc=AdpPZuktTUQz_gZELNGUbkCh2IWS7ul1PaSJ-FlotVVOdj_AG0SguFK7bsLU8F377as&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9d3AuB-OMk14uz5O2JAJa5nBl2uxg9umVC2fwzqUTfbQ&oe=6A2FFB2B"}, "display_name": "The Finders", "keywords": ["pet", "cat", "finding", "challenge", "finder"], "long_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore maps, complete exciting quests, play various mini-games, hang out with other players (Coming Soon), collect objects, and level up to become the best \"Finder.\"\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbCute animals\n\u30fbSandbox exploration\n\u30fbMain quest \n\u30fbMini-games\n\nMore features will be added every month. So, stay tuned with us!", "short_description": "\"The Finders\" is a VR game that challenges players to find objects throughout Pet-World. It\u2019s a mini open-world game where players can explore